Prerequisites:

GNU Make >= 3.82
Perl >= 5.000
recent ifort compiler
HDF5 compiled with fortran and parallel support,
  i.e. with --enable-parallel --enable-fortran --enable-fortran2003
  Example:
  CC=mpiicc FC=mpiifort ./configure --prefix=/csc/home0/dvanvugt/usr --enable-parallel --enable-fortran --enable-fortran2003

